            "HotelCode": "1015014",
            "HotelName": "Dive Point Alcoy Resort",
            "Description": "Here in Alcoy we offer full service for a great scuba diving trip in the Philippines. Equipped with modern dive equipment, experienced dive instructors and friendly service staff, it is our pleasure to make your holiday trip unforgettable. Our own restaurant offers you freshly made regional and international dishes. All our rooms have air conditioning and free Wifi. Featuring an outdoor pool and terrace, Divepoint Alcoy is situated in Alcoy, 47 km from Dumaguete. Surrounded by lush greenery, it offers a bar and restaurant, and provides free WiFi access throughout the property. Modern dive equipments with experienced dive instructors are available.\n\nCertain rooms feature a seating area to relax in after a busy day. Views of the sea, pool or garden are featured in selected rooms. All rooms include a private bathroom fitted with shower facility.\n\nScuba diving and guided land tours can be arranged. Guests can enjoy exploring the waterfalls, caves and the rural side of the island. A pool table is featured on site, while airport transfers and shuttle services are available upon request.\n\nMoalboal is 31 km from Divepoint Alcoy, while Tagbilaran City is approximately 39 km away. Please inform Divepoint Alcoy in advance of your expected arrival time. You can use the Special Requests box when booking, or contact the property directly with the contact details provided in your confirmation.\nPlease note that the propertys boat will be docked from 14 May 2017 to 13 June 2017. As a result, day trips for outer island dives is unavailable. The propertys smaller boat is available for local dives.<br/><b>Disclaimer notification: Amenities are subject to availability and may be chargeable as per the hotel policy.</b>",
